This zip file contains connection parameters for various Rithmic systems and
their gateways.  The version number corresponds to the configuration associated
with a particular version of R | Trader / R | Trader Pro.

Each file contains settings for one gateway of a Rithmic system.  The file
naming format is
<RithmicSystem>_<Gateway>_connection_params.<RTraderProVersion>.txt.

Not all systems/gateways have an aggregated market data connect point.

Please note that these files will provide you with connection parameters you
will need to connect an R | API application to various systems like Rithmic 01
or Rithmic Paper Trading.  However, they do not include credentials to log in.

To log in successfully, you will need to have valid credentials for the
particular system.

In addition, please note that Rithmic systems do not always permit
applications to connect.  If you find that you unexpectedly cannot log in to a
particular system, please contact the administrators of that system as the
login failures may be due to permission restrictions at a higher level than
the login id.
